    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome Skaters!</strong></h2>Experience the thrill of <strong>TRICKSHOT</strong> - a revolutionary multiplayer shooter that's redefining the genre! Command your hoverboard or hoverskates and outperform rivals with epic skate tricks in diverse interstellar arenas.<br><br>Fuel up with Health, Shields, and Ammo by skating, and rack up bonus points with successive tricks, parkour, tackles, power-ups, and slides. Eliminate opponents, but remember - it's not just about the kill count! Only the player with the highest points at the end of the match prevails.<br><br><i>Drawing inspiration from the swift skate mechanics of Tony Hawk Pro Skater &amp; Jet Set Radio, and the rapid-fire gunplay from shooters like Doom Eternal, TRICKSHOT offers an electrifying fusion of exhilarating action and strategy.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234920/extras/40f8f306a9be962fdb50c0160a05d7f2.poster.avif?t=1702400705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234920/extras/40f8f306a9be962fdb50c0160a05d7f2.webm?t=1702400705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234920/extras/40f8f306a9be962fdb50c0160a05d7f2.mp4?t=1702400705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Customize your skater character to reflect your unique flair<br></li><li>ngage in epic battles online in diverse skatepark arenas<br></li><li>Experience both offline and online play featuring player bots<br></li><li>Conquer thrilling ramps, master sick grind rails, flip and dive with parkouring <br></li><li>Take a breather from the intense PvP action and unwind with friends in your very own Personal Skate Park HUB World</li></ul><br>Your <strong>WISHLISTs</strong> and positive energy means the world to us! Stay in the loop with all the latest game updates by joining our <strong>DISCORD</strong> community. Thanks for dropping by!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234920/extras/6f32d33d95fbf8b679fe0a33b87a7217.poster.avif?t=1702400705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234920/extras/6f32d33d95fbf8b679fe0a33b87a7217.webm?t=1702400705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234920/extras/6f32d33d95fbf8b679fe0a33b87a7217.mp4?t=1702400705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></i>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome Skaters!</strong></h2>Experience the thrill of <strong>TRICKSHOT</strong> - a revolutionary multiplayer shooter that's redefining the genre! Command your hoverboard or hoverskates and outperform rivals with epic skate tricks in diverse interstellar arenas.<br><br>Fuel up with Health, Shields, and Ammo by skating, and rack up bonus points with successive tricks, parkour, tackles, power-ups, and slides. Eliminate opponents, but remember - it's not just about the kill count! Only the player with the highest points at the end of the match prevails.<br><br><i>Drawing inspiration from the swift skate mechanics of Tony Hawk Pro Skater &amp; Jet Set Radio, and the rapid-fire gunplay from shooters like Doom Eternal, TRICKSHOT offers an electrifying fusion of exhilarating action and strategy.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234920/extras/40f8f306a9be962fdb50c0160a05d7f2.poster.avif?t=1702400705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234920/extras/40f8f306a9be962fdb50c0160a05d7f2.webm?t=1702400705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234920/extras/40f8f306a9be962fdb50c0160a05d7f2.mp4?t=1702400705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Customize your skater character to reflect your unique flair<br></li><li>ngage in epic battles online in diverse skatepark arenas<br></li><li>Experience both offline and online play featuring player bots<br></li><li>Conquer thrilling ramps, master sick grind rails, flip and dive with parkouring <br></li><li>Take a breather from the intense PvP action and unwind with friends in your very own Personal Skate Park HUB World</li></ul><br>Your <strong>WISHLISTs</strong> and positive energy means the world to us! Stay in the loop with all the latest game updates by joining our <strong>DISCORD</strong> community. Thanks for dropping by!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234920/extras/6f32d33d95fbf8b679fe0a33b87a7217.poster.avif?t=1702400705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234920/extras/6f32d33d95fbf8b679fe0a33b87a7217.webm?t=1702400705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234920/extras/6f32d33d95fbf8b679fe0a33b87a7217.mp4?t=1702400705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></i>",
